        "storyContext": "Aman's family wants to build a rectangular swimming pool with a 4-meter concrete border around it. The outer dimensions are 20m × 16m. Aman needs to find the inner pool dimensions such that the border area equals the pool area. He discovers this leads to a quadratic equation!",
