          "solution": "In triangle ABT: angle TAB = 90°, AB = 100m. In similar triangle formed by her measurements, if she measures a proportional distance: tan(30°) = AT/AB → AT = 100 × tan(30°) = 100/√3 ≈ 57.7m"
