        "kind": "title",
        "title": "Light - Reflection and Refraction",
        "storyContext": "Ajay runs a mirror stall in the local market. One afternoon, Priya stops by and asks him: \"Do you know the actual science behind why mirrors work?\" Ajay realizes he's never thought about it deeply.",
