        "storyContext": "Arun's family owns a small shop. His father asks him to never give credit to Ravi, a boy from a rich family who never pays back. But one day, Ravi asks for books on credit, and Arun agrees—wanting to keep Ravi as a friend. When his father finds out, he's angry. Arun feels ashamed. That night, Meera hears him sitting alone and knows something is wrong.",
