        "kind": "story",
        "title": "Why Grandmother Won't Throw It Away",
        "storyContext": "Asha notices her grandmother sits in the same wooden chair every morning. The paint is chipped, one leg is slightly shorter than the others, and it creaks when anyone sits down. 'Dadi, why don't we buy a new chair?' Asha asks. Grandmother smiles sadly and says, 'This chair is not furniture. This chair is memory.'",
