        "title": "The Fast Ball at the Match",
        "storyContext": "During a village cricket match, a fast bowler releases the ball. It zooms past the batter in a blur. Coach Dev says: 'That's a 90 km/h ball.' Vikram asks: 'How do they know it's going 90 and not 80?' Sneha pulls out a notebook: 'It's about distance and time.'",
