          "solution": "(3a + 2b)² = 9a² + 12ab + 4b². (3a − 2b)² = 9a² − 12ab + 4b². Difference = 24ab.\nFor factorization: 16m² − 9n² = (4m)² − (3n)² = (4m + 3n)(4m − 3n)."
