          "solution": "(a) Even numbers: 2, 4, 6 (3 favorable outcomes out of 6). P = 3/6 = 1/2 = 0.5 = 50%.\n(b) Numbers > 4: 5, 6 (2 favorable outcomes out of 6). P = 2/6 = 1/3 ≈ 0.333 = 33.3%."
